Therefore, I will evaluate the **Mercedes-Benz GLE AMG Line**, using the popular GLE 300d 4MATIC engine as a baseline configuration for this trim. This trim adds AMG-inspired bumpers, wheels, steering wheel, and often slightly firmer suspension compared to a hypothetical base model, but uses the standard engine range.

